    "source_book_raw": "Pathfinder Roleplaying Game Monster Codex",
    "definition_raw": "Unlike others of your kind, you are able to pull your prey toward yourself.\n\nPrerequisite(s): Str 17, sticky tongue.\n\nBenefit(s): Your tongue attack gains the pull special ability.\n\nAt the start of your turn, if your tongue is attached to a target of your size or smaller and you succeed at a combat maneuver check, you can pull the target 5 feet closer to you as free action.",
